  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3212.01 Determination of Compliance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3212.01 Determination of Compliance. Monitored emissions data as reported by the budget source to the NETS administrator, and as adjusted by the administrator to be in accordance with Env-A 3209,\n\ncombined with allowance allocations and transfers recorded in the NATS, shall provide the basis for a determination of compliance with this chapter.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3200.html"
